# Signal Integrity agents

When implementing Signal Integrity Interview, follow `.cursor/agents/`:

- Backend, Frontend, ScenarioAuthor, Eval implement their slice.
- QA_Agent runs the matrix and files findings.
- BugFixer closes ≥medium findings with regression tests before the slice is commit-ready.
- DevOps owns branch/PR/CI and commit identity rules.

Do not mark Signal Integrity done while QA_Agent has open ≥medium bugs or CI is failing.
Classic oral mode must remain usable unless the owner explicitly retires it.
